The Pareto chart below shows the reasons that customers returned jeans purchased online during July 2025.

\exfigure{1370_q6_1}

The manager of online business wishes to address at least 80% of returns by making the fewest changes to company processes.

solutions.latex:
\exfigure{1370_q24_s2}

Rewrite $y=\ln x$ as $x=e^y$; region $A$ lies between the curve and the $y$ axis for $0\le y\le 2$:

$$\begin{aligned} \text{Area}&=\int_0^2 e^y\,dy\\ &=\Big[e^y\Big]_0^2\\ &=e^2-e^0\\ &=e^2-1 \end{aligned}$$
